        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Compact Pro Tools-inspired automation panel for REAPER audio post-production. Windows x64 native JUCE extension with a bundled Lua engine. Restart REAPER after installation. Run EA: Native Automation (JUCE) - toggle panel. Search EA: Automation to assign shortcuts. Includes Preview/Capture, Manual Write, Write on Stop, copy/paste/fill, adaptive docking and themes. Known issues: native track volume/pan Manual Write and envelope lane visibility still require live host confirmation. macOS/Linux source only; no installable binaries for those platforms yet. AGPL-3.0-or-later. Complete corresponding source and dependency archives are linked below.\par}
}
]]></description>
